<section class="teams-panel"><h2>Entre com sua conta para continuar</h2><p>A identidade é individual. Depois do login você poderá cadastrar um Team ou acessar os que administra.</p>
<div id="g_id_onload" data-client_id="921450846888-qa9a1alk06v6i0ao4jbiihdfrn8j7528.apps.googleusercontent.com" data-callback="teamsCredential" data-auto_select="false" data-auto_prompt="false" data-nonce="<cfoutput>#encodeForHTMLAttribute(SESSION.businessLoginNonce)#</cfoutput>"></div><div class="g_id_signin" data-type="standard" data-size="large"></div>
<form id="teams-google-login" method="post" action="/teams/"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="googlesignin"><input type="hidden" name="credential" value=""><input type="hidden" name="business_login_csrf" value="<cfoutput>#encodeForHTMLAttribute(SESSION.businessLoginCsrf)#</cfoutput>"><input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="<cfoutput>#encodeForHTMLAttribute(teamLoginReturn)#</cfoutput>"></form>
<script>function teamsCredential(response){if(!response||!response.credential)return;var f=document.getElementById('teams-google-login');f.elements.credential.value=response.credential;f.submit();}</script><script src="https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client" async defer></script></section>
